<title>HONG KONG: S.China Holdings interim net up sharply.</title>
<headline>S.China Holdings interim net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.4    vs 0.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.5    vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 4.82 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    13.02  vs 1.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		     775.32 vs 718.87</p>
<p>    Company name		 South China Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 10-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 23</p>
<p>NOTE - South China Holdings is an investment holding and property investment company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
